  "name": "Key figures",
  "category": "Product: content",
  "settings": [
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Serving, servings and price per day or serving come from the metafields in Theme settings → Product data. Add up to two more figures here, also connected to a metafield. A value like “3/5” is shown as a scale."
   },
   {
